      "$f = f_1 + f_2 + f_3$",
      "$f = \\sqrt{f_1^2 + f_2^2 + f_3^2}$",
      "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{f}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{f_1}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{f_2}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{f_3}}$"
